                                "sense_id": "d78f97f2-3675-312e-97f6-8f6e4de95b47",
                                "text": "So he began, being an Edwardian, by describing accurately and minutely the sort of house Hilda lived in, and the sort of house she saw from the window. House property was the common ground from which the Edwardians found it easy to proceed to intimacy."
